{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Natural World", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Our Earth", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Showing That You Understand Someone's Feelings", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">must</span> followed by an adjective when you want to empathize with someone. When you empathize with someone, you show them that you understand their feelings.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is the structure to follow:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "subject + <span class=\"italic\">must</span> + verb + adjective", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">You must feel depressed.<br/>You must be excited.<br/>They must be shocked!<br/>It must be terrifying to do that!</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use either <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> adjectives or <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> adjectives. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Don't forget to include the verb before the adjective.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Paul</span>: I've stayed up all night.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: You must be tired.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tania</span>: It must be fascinating living in Europe.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Yeah, it is!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Making Suggestions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modals to give advice and make suggestions. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The most common modals for giving advice are: <br/><span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can think of modals as \u201chelping verbs\u201d. They add meaning to the main verb of a sentence. In this case, these modals add the meaning of advice and suggestion.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Should</span> is the most common modal used to give advice and to make suggestions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> are used for giving strong advice and making strong suggestions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Verb\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">should</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">read</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">more about wildlife preservation.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">ought to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">be</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">more careful about disposing of our garbage.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">had better</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">do</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">more to protect the whales.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "In conversation, it is common to use contractions with <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You ought to watch more wildlife documentaries. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should consider a \u201cgreen\u201d trip.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You'd better become more aware of the illicit trade in your country.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "preservation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the action of keeping something or someone safe from harm ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: All over the world, wildlife preservation organizations are trying to protect whales.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "extinct", "type": "name"}, {"content": "no longer existing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Organizations are trying to protect whales from becoming extinct.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to wipe out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to completely remove from existence", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Wildlife documentaries are a good reminder that some animals are in danger of being wiped out or already may be extinct.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "disconnected", "type": "name"}, {"content": "removed from an issue; out of touch", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I feel so disconnected from the natural world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "documentary", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a television program that provides a factual record or report", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I ought to watch more documentaries about wildlife.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Arctic ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "related to the area around the North Pole", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You could go on an Arctic cruise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "seal ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a fish-eating mammalwith a streamlined body and feet developed as flippers that lives in the ocean", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can see seals on an Arctic cruise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "polar bear", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large, white bear found in the Arctic", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can see polar bears on an Arctic cruise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "walrus", "type": "name"}, {"content": "A large animal found in the Arctic Ocean that possesses two large downward-pointing tusks", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can see walruses on your Arctic cruise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "illicit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "illegal", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are many illicit actions against wildlife.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le12ob11aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and find these songs and the lyrics to these songs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen and read along.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What message are these singers trying to convey?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about the songs and what you think they are about with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I listen to and read lyrics of one or two songs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I consider the message in the song(s).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the songs with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le12ob11re2img03.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le12ob11re2img03.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Well readers, over the last week, I've written a few blog posts related to the preservation of wildlife and how we can change the way we think about all things \u201cgreen\u201d. I know you must be tired of hearing about climate change and ecological issues, but here are some points that I hope you will consider:"}, {"image": "engenn7le12ob11re2img01.jpg", "time": "18000", "id": 2, "text": "<ul><li>You ought to watch more wildlife documentaries - they are a good reminder that some animals are in danger of being wiped out or already may be extinct.</li><li>You should consider a \u201cgreen\u201d trip - like whale watching or an Arctic cruise. Seeing animals like polar bears, narwhals, walruses and seals in their natural habitat can help you feel less disconnected from the world.</li><li>You'd better become more aware of the illicit trade and poaching of protected animals in your country.</li></ul>"}, {"image": "engenn7le12ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "50000", "id": 3, "text": "If you could do one of these things, which one would you choose? If we all decided to make a small change in the way we lived and thought about our world, we could make a big difference! You must be excited to try something out!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le12ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le12ob11re2img03.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about nature and the animal world.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can show I understand someone's feelings. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about hypothetical situations and how to deal with problems. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What are your favorite animals?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What would you do if you knew that your favorite animals were endangered?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's review!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally blogs about our world. What does she suggest?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2},